  "description": {
    "text": "Two-packs that Toys \"R\" Us sold from 27 April 2011, each with two Black & White booster packs and one of three promos hidden behind a card showing their silhouettes: Pansage BW14, Pidove BW15 or Axew BW16. They went with the store's Secret Egg promotion, in which players downloaded an Egg to Pokémon Black or White that hatched into one of the same three: Cilan's Pansage, Ash's Pidove or Iris's Axew from the anime. All three arts first came in Japan in December 2010, on promos given out at 7-Eleven stores.",
